          "definition": "Loving and beloved; as a divine epithet, the One who loves His servants and is beloved by the righteous.",
          "usage_conditions": "In the Quran it is an epithet of God, combining divine love toward servants with the resulting love or approval directed toward Him.",
          "source_refs": [
